 <section class="nl-steps" aria-label="From watching to learning">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">01 · Listen & repeat</p><h2>Stay with a phrase.</h2><p>Hear real speech, replay a phrase and say it back. Shadowing gives you a small, repeatable moment to practise pronunciation and rhythm.</p></div>
  <div><p class="eyebrow">02 · Understand</p><h2>Keep the meaning close.</h2><p>Show a translation when you need it. Click a word in the phrase to explore its dictionary meaning and examples without leaving the video.</p></div>
  <div><p class="eyebrow">03 · Keep it</p><h2>Take a word with you.</h2><p>With a connected 2000nl account, start learning a useful word from its card. Return to it later in your vocabulary practice.</p></div>
 </section>
 <section class="af-phrase-feature">
  <div class="nl-feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A little less scrubbing. A little more speaking.</p><h2>The phrase is<br/>your practice unit.</h2><p>Move back, repeat, or go forward. Hide the original when you want to test yourself, and reveal it when you need support.</p><p>The prototype explores Shadow and Recall modes, phrase translation and adjustable playback speed.</p></div>
  <figure class="af-ribbon-shot"><img src="/images/audiofilms/phrase-ribbon.jpg" width="1002" height="208" loading="lazy" alt="AudioFilms phrase ribbon with clickable Dutch words, Shadow and Recall modes, Previous, Repeat and Next buttons, and translation controls."/></figure>
 </section>
 <section class="nl-feature af-dictionary-feature">
  <div class="nl-feature-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Connected to 2000nl</p><h2>From a word in a video<br/>to a word you know.</h2><p>The dictionary card is part of the same vocabulary world as <a href="/2000nl/">2000nl</a>. Read a definition, see an example, and choose to learn the word.</p><p>Our own Dutch learner’s dictionary, Dilum Nederlands, is already connected in the test prototype.</p><a class="nl-secondary" href="/2000nl/">Explore vocabulary practice in 2000nl ↗</a></div>
  <figure class="af-dictionary-shot"><img src="/images/audiofilms/dictionary-lookup.jpg" width="435" height="285" loading="lazy" alt="The Dilum Nederlands card for het ziekenhuis in AudioFilms, with a definition, example sentence and Start Learning button."/></figure>
 </section>
 <section class="af-status"><p class="eyebrow">Where the project stands</p><h2>A working idea.<br/>Still taking shape.</h2><p>This is an experimental prototype, connected to 2000nl for testing. Playback, subtitles, translations and the interface are still being refined. It is not a finished product or a public extension-store release.</p><p>Interested in trying it or helping shape it? <a href="mailto:contact@dilum.io?subject=AudioFilms%20early%20testing">Get in touch about early testing ↗</a></p></section>
